     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear shiny developers,<br><br>I try to develop an shiny app for analysis of biological images, i.e. the shiny app will upload an image (of a biological tissue for instance) and the user will have to click on the image to place the nucleus of each cell to finally get the coordinates of each nucleus (and thus draw a map of the tissue).<br><br>Sometimes the cells are so small that users will have to zoom on the picture to see correctly the nucleus.<br><br>So I tried to develop an app allowing users to zoom on their picture. Basically I planned to use the zoom of the shiny <code><span>plotOutput</span><span></span></code> (<a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/plot-interaction-zoom.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/plot-interaction-zoom.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391791907000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sC9g7YT2NQcdupGDpRlh_\">http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/plot-interaction-zoom.html</a>) but few weeks ago I found this beautiful package of svgPanZoom and I would like to combine it with my shiny app. <br><br>For including svgPanZoom in the app no problem, but it gets more complicated when I try to have a &quot;locator&quot; in the app (like a &quot;clickId&quot; from the function <code><span>plotOutput</span><span>)</span></code>. I can&#39;t get the solution of my problem...<br>I would have probably to custom the renderSvgPanZoom function but I did not reach my goal.<br><br>Do you have an idea ?<br><br>Here I put a simple code for renderSvgPanZoom. Here I would like to include a clickId or a locator in this script:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">svglite</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">svgPanZoom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Plant</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Plant1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Plant1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Plant1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Plant2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Plant2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                                </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Plant2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Axis1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                                                                                 </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Axis2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bootstrapPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  svgPanZoomOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;main_plot&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$main_plot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderSvgPanZoom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    p </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Axis1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Axis2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shape </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Plant</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    svgPanZoom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> controlIconsEnabled </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>runApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><br>I try to find an answer on internet but I found nothing even by asking questions (perhaps I was not clear enough, I hope this message will be clear enough) <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/39817784/r-svgpanzoom-customize-size-and-add-locator?noredirect=1#comment66926839_39817784\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/39817784/r-svgpanzoom-customize-size-and-add-locator?noredirect%3D1%23comment66926839_39817784&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391791907000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1FvuM4jK8XYAQ5c-Ud5p7p\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/39817784/r-svgpanzoom-customize-size-and-add-locator?noredirect=1#comment66926839_39817784</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/timelyportfolio/svgPanZoom/issues/16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/timelyportfolio/svgPanZoom/issues/16&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792391791907000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03bbcCYfWwcmhaYK_4ysbx\">https://github.com/timelyportfolio/svgPanZoom/issues/16</a><br><br>Thank you very much in advance for any help !<br><br>Have a nice day.<br><br>Charlotte<br><br></div>"
